<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLanguageMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:LanguageMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference, or rml:constant\n    with the BCP47 name of the language as string.\n    " .
